# Two Ancient Adamantoises (the ruling: "you choose which redirection effect to apply ... which of those Ancient
# Adamantoises will take that damage"; you can't divide it or take it yourself). Each applies to an event once (CR 614.5),
# and once one has applied the event is judged again (CR 616.1f): Bolt aimed at Bot1, the first one's effect makes it
# damage to the first, which is another permanent Bot1 controls, so the second's effect then makes it damage to the
# second, and the first's has had its turn. So the effect Bot1 chooses first decides which one ends with the damage.
# Bot2's first Bolt: Bot1 applies #1's effect first, and #2 takes 3. Second Bolt: #2's first, and #1 takes 3. Third
# Bolt, aimed at #1 (Bot2 pays its ward {3}): only #2's effect applies (#1's is about "other" permanents), then #1's, and
# the 3 come back to #1 with no choice to make. Bot1 loses no life.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Show and Tell
Show and Tell
Ancient Adamantoise
Ancient Adamantoise
Forest
Island
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Sol Ring
Black Lotus
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mountain x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Ancient Adamantoise)
Bot2.Choose()
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Ancient Adamantoise)
Bot2.Choose()
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Replace(Ancient Adamantoise#1)
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ancient Adamantoise#1.Damage = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ancient Adamantoise#2.Damage = 3
Bot1.Replace(Ancient Adamantoise#2)
Bot2.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ancient Adamantoise#1)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ancient Adamantoise#1.Damage = 3
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ancient Adamantoise#2.Damage = 3
Bot2.PayCost
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield.Ancient Adamantoise#1.Damage = 6
Bot1.Battlefield.Ancient Adamantoise#2.Damage = 3
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus; Lightning Bolt; Lightning Bolt
